From: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
Date: Fri, 05 Jun 2026 14:07:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha_eth: disable eth monitor 

breaks GDM mapping on ifconfig down/up

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth_extra.c |    1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth_extra.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth_extra.c
@@ -83,7 +83,6 @@ static int arht_extra_hw_init(struct air
 
 	airoha_qdma_multicast_init(eth);
 	arht_ppe_init(ppe);
-	airoha_eth_monitor_workqueue_init();
 	airoha_dp_api_debugfs_init(eth);
 	return 0;
 }
